2. J. Albrecht &amp; J. Quadt, “Centrifuges and Their Chemical Applications,” *Chemical Engineering*, vol. 45, pp. 78-93, 2018. (link)
3. International Organization for Standardization (ISO). “ISO 22000:2018 - Food safety management systems.” (link)
